    "debug.sample.code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Code examples\n\n## Shell\n\n```sh\nprintf '%s\\n' 'Hello, Alethe'\nfind . -name '*.md' -type f\n```\n\n## JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Sample workspace\",\n  \"features\": [\"markdown\", \"todos\"],\n  \"enabled\": true\n}\n```\n\n## Long lines\n\n```typescript\nconst description = \"A deliberately long source line to check horizontal scrolling, monospace rendering, padding, and clipping without wrapping the code block in a narrow Markdown sidebar.\"\n```\n\n## Inline formatting\n\nUse `npm test`, **review the output**, then *record the result*. A link inside a list: [Swift documentation](https://www.swift.org/documentation/).\n"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Exemplos de código\n\n## Shell\n\n```sh\nprintf '%s\\n' 'Hello, Alethe'\nfind . -name '*.md' -type f\n```\n\n## JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Sample workspace\",\n  \"features\": [\"markdown\", \"todos\"],\n  \"enabled\": true\n}\n```\n\n## Linhas longas\n\n```typescript\nconst description = \"A deliberately long source line to check horizontal scrolling, monospace rendering, padding, and clipping without wrapping the code block in a narrow Markdown sidebar.\"\n```\n\n## Formatação em linha\n\nUse `npm test`, **revise a saída** e *registre o resultado*. Um link em uma lista: [Documentação do Swift](https://www.swift.org/documentation/).\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "debug.sample.error" : {
